{"obsah":"<p>A 'small' ball with 2,000 guests was organised by students of the Czech University of Life Sciences (CZU) in Prague. </p>\n\n<p>They thought they'd like something a bit edgier and called our team to come along. Vlasta and Luky packed the obstacles and launched a show in the main hall for a great audience. Admittedly, volunteers were hard to find given the formal dress, but a few brave souls came forward. Luky had a few technical problems, but everything was handled and the exhibition went as it should. Thanks to the organisers for the invitation and the hospitality.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/qOOrUFrLCUw?t=52\n</div></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F03%2FPles%C2%A8ZU_2023-035.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F03%2FPles%C2%A8ZU_2023-035.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-232587\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F03%2FPles%C2%A8ZU_2023-037.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F03%2FPles%C2%A8ZU_2023-037.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-232591\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F03%2FPles%C2%A8ZU_2023-041.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage